From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: RestServer <restserver@local>
Date: Mon, 17 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0500
Subject: [PATCH] RestServer bootstrap and authoritative engine selection

The server.properties version key is read before Minecraft bootstrap. This
1.21.11 build refuses to load registries/worlds if another engine is requested.

diff --git a/net/minecraft/server/Main.java b/net/minecraft/server/Main.java
--- a/net/minecraft/server/Main.java
+++ b/net/minecraft/server/Main.java
@@ -100,6 +100,8 @@ public class Main {
                 writePidFile(path);
             }
 
+            fun.restserver.core.RestServerBootstrap.earlyInit(optionSet); // RestServer - early engine/version gate
+
             org.dreeam.leaf.config.LeafConfig.loadConfig(); // Leaf - Leaf config
 
             CrashReport.preload();
